		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Abyssal construct, mobile spiked cage. A dizzying collection of lethal traps jammed into one device.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 spike +4 (1d8 + grab) or encage, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Encage</strong>. Grabbed target trapped inside urannag, takes 2d6 damage per round, STR 18+ to escape.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Living Trap</strong>. DEX 18+ to disarm as per a trap, destroys urannag.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
